---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/layout/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/layout/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Focus Pet"
  description="How Focus Pet handles your data."
>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16">
      <a href="/" class="font-heading font-semibold text-text-secondary no-underline hover:text-accent-blue">
        &larr; Back to Home
      </a>

      <div class="mt-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold md:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-text-secondary">Last updated July 23, 2026.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-8 text-text-secondary">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Focus Pet collects only the information necessary to provide its features.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Depending on how you use the app, this may include:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Your email address (if you create an account).</li>
            <li>Your game progress, achievements, settings, and statistics.</li>
            <li>Information about your active focus sessions.</li>
            <li>The names of running applications required to determine whether your selected focus application is active.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">How Application Detection Works</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Focus Pet checks which applications are currently running on your computer in order to detect when a
            focus session is active.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">This information is used solely to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>determine whether your selected focus application is running;</li>
            <li>track focus duration;</li>
            <li>award in-game progress and achievements;</li>
            <li>generate focus statistics.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">Focus Pet does not read or collect:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>the contents of files or documents;</li>
            <li>the contents of websites;</li>
            <li>text entered into applications;</li>
            <li>passwords or personal credentials;</li>
            <li>keyboard or mouse input;</li>
            <li>screenshots or screen recordings.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Focus Pet only identifies the running applications necessary for its focus-tracking functionality.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Cloud Saves</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            If you create a Focus Pet account, your gameplay data may be securely stored using our cloud services so
            your progress can be synchronized across supported devices.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">This may include:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>game progress;</li>
            <li>decorations and inventory;</li>
            <li>achievements;</li>
            <li>focus statistics;</li>
            <li>settings;</li>
            <li>account information associated with your email address.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We use trusted third-party providers to operate certain features of Focus Pet. These include:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li><span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">Supabase</span> for authentication and cloud save services.</li>
            <li><span class="font-semibold text-text-primary">RevenueCat</span> for subscription and purchase management (if applicable).</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">These providers process data in accordance with their own privacy policies.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">We use collected information to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>provide and improve Focus Pet;</li>
            <li>synchronize your game progress;</li>
            <li>authenticate your account;</li>
            <li>maintain application functionality;</li>
            <li>provide customer support;</li>
            <li>diagnose bugs and improve stability.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your personal information.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Data Retention</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We retain your account and gameplay data only for as long as necessary to provide the services you use
            or until you request that your account be deleted, unless a longer retention period is required by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>access your personal information;</li>
            <li>correct inaccurate information;</li>
            <li>request deletion of your account and associated data;</li>
            <li>withdraw consent where applicable.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To exercise these rights, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:help@tryfocuspet.com">help@tryfocuspet.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Security</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration,
            disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission over the internet is
            completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">If this policy changes, we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text-primary">Questions</h2>
          <p class="mt-2">
            If you have questions about how your data is handled, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:help@tryfocuspet.com">help@tryfocuspet.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
